homelab-svc-hosts (0.0.9) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial package: manage a BEGIN/END block in /etc/hosts from
    /etc/homelab/svc-hosts/hosts.yml, mapping stable internal service names
    (api.svc.homelab, pgbouncer.svc.homelab, db.svc.homelab) to their 10.50
    service-plane VIPs. Idempotent, atomic write; `mode: dns` removes the
    block to converge on an authoritative svc.homelab DNS zone later.

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:00:00 -0500
